#
# Single source of truth for the Eiraman Guide read by the build (the English text, and the Italian translation
# when the commit contains it). The first line that is not a comment is the full commit SHA of eiraman/guide,
# never a branch or a tag. Read by generator/build.py (which refuses a checkout at another commit) and by
# .github/workflows/site-build.yml. Updating it is a reviewed change, with the Guide version below.
# Guide version: 1.0.0-rc.5 (release candidate)
